One ledger for Claude, Codex, local models, homelab machines and cloud GPUs:
tokens, GPU hours, kWh and money, side by side.

    computai                         # live dashboard (on a terminal)
    computai --summary --month       # this month's totals
    computai --line                  # "Claude 42%｜Codex 100%｜today $3.2"
